msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anyone who tried to get close to me had to have some ulterior motive—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like Aimee, "
"who had only done so to satisfy Mother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫かつてエメが、⟪k:1⟫母に言われて仕方なく私と接したように……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫誰かが私に親しくするのは、"
